A move leaves the last node below the source linking up to the emptied slot,
so the children of the moved capability lead into a slot that holds nothing.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-rp2350 fuzz-smp2 fuzz-work test qemu-replay
Report: link up to a slot that is not a live, filled one
Witness: fuzz actor-handoff

diff --git a/kernel/cap.c b/kernel/cap.c
--- a/kernel/cap.c
+++ b/kernel/cap.c
@@ -141,9 +141,6 @@ void cap_move(struct cap *from, struct cap *to)
             cap_set_next(pred, v2p(to));
         }
     }
-    if (cap_child(from) != 0) {
-        cap_set_next(node(cap_prev(node(cap_child(from)))), v2p(to) | LINK_UP);
-    }
     *from = (struct cap){ 0 };
 }
 
